{
  "version": "2.21",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "oOZbE",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Brief · Auth",
      "width": 360,
      "fill": "$bg-muted",
      "cornerRadius": "$radius-md",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": "$space-4",
      "padding": "$space-5",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uPP4L",
          "name": "BT",
          "fill": "$fg-default",
          "content": "Auth — brief",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "BKJIf",
          "name": "BB",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "kit-version-source: 1.3.0 · updated: 2026-10-21\n\n1. PURPOSE\nThe doors into a single-user instance: login, the second factor (ADR-018), password recovery, the two TOTP screens enrolment reaches, and the static error pages Rails serves from public/. No signup — the one account is created by the first-boot setup wizard (onboarding.pen).\n\n2. ENTRY POINTS\n- Login — / redirects to /login (sessions#new)\n- 2FA and Código de recuperación — only with a pending login, after the password step (/two-factor, /recovery-code)\n- Forgot → Email sent → Reset → Enlace expirado or Contraseña actualizada — \"¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?\" on Login (/forgot-password, /reset-password/:token)\n- TOTP · Alta and Códigos de recuperación — from Ajustes' Seguridad row (/two-factor/setup, /two-factor/codes). Opened from the wizard's Seguridad step (D52), TOTP · Alta wears the wizard's frame, drawn in onboarding.pen (D122); Códigos wears the same bare frame from both doors (D148)\n- Errores — public/404.html, 429.html and 500.html, served by Rails with no layout when a request fails\n\n3. SCREENS (left → right, by band)\n- Login band: Login · Default · Login · Error · 2FA · Código de recuperación\n- Recuperar contraseña band: Forgot · Email sent · Reset · Enlace expirado · Contraseña actualizada\n- Second factor band (from Ajustes): TOTP · Alta · Códigos de recuperación — neither is the auth card: Alta renders in the app shell, Códigos in a bare column with no chrome (D148); this file draws the Ajustes entry. Códigos renders the same page as onboarding.pen's Seguridad · Códigos; each file keeps it as its journey's entry\n- Errores band: 404 · 429 (one button) · 500 — hand-written HTML with inline CSS, drawn as shipped: the Soft Candle wordmark at 174×40 (the app's glyph and lettering, inlined), a white canvas, Material Symbols icons; the primary button is primary-fg behind fg-inverse, the help line fg-subtle with its link in primary-fg\n- Desktop band: Login\n\n4. BUSINESS RULES\n- Every screen from Login to Contraseña actualizada renders in layouts/auth: one centred card at every width, the wordmark inside it, outcome screens included (D152). Login's desktop artboard shows the same card at its max-w-md and stands for all of them (D4)\n- TOTP · Alta renders in layouts/app with HeaderBar back to Ajustes once the account is onboarded; the nav lights Ajustes. Mid-wizard it renders in layouts/onboarding under the step header (D122). Códigos renders in layouts/onboarding with no HeaderBar, nav or step header from either door, because the codes are destroyed as the page paints; its one exit is Ya los guardé, continuar, to Ajustes or to the summary (D148)\n- Every password field carries a reveal toggle (Mostrar contraseña)\n- 2FA states the window it allows: Tienes 10 minutos para verificar… (TwoFactorController::PENDING_TIMEOUT)\n- Email sent ranks its two actions: Reenviar enlace is a text link, Volver a iniciar sesión the primary button\n- Email OTP and SMS are out: a lost authenticator is answered by one-time recovery codes, ten of them, shown once (ADR-018)\n- Email sent says the same thing whether or not the address exists, so the page cannot confirm an account (password_resets/sent.html.erb)\n- The reset window is stated from User::PASSWORD_RESET_EXPIRES_IN, never in prose\n- The codes are not downloadable: the list is select-all and the page warns they are not shown again\n- The error pages are not in I18n: their copy lives in the HTML files. Ir al inicio goes to /, which redirects to /login or onward to /dashboard\n\n5. COPY SOURCE\nconfig/locales/es-MX.yml — auth.*, two_factor.*, totp_enrollments.*. Errores: public/400.html, 404.html, 406-unsupported-browser.html, 422.html, 429.html, 500.html. Failure messages: Identity::UseCases::Login, VerifyTotpCode, ConsumeRecoveryCode.\n\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\n- 2FA and Código de recuperación with a wrong code — the Login · Error alert above the form, reading \"Ese código no es válido.\"; TOTP · Alta reads \"Ese código no es válido. Revisa tu app de autenticación.\"\n- Login after the pending second factor timed out — a toast, not the inline alert: \"Se agotó el tiempo para verificar. Inicia sesión otra vez.\"\n- Login reached after setup already ran — the inline alert reads \"Esta instancia ya está configurada.\"\n- Reset with an invalid password — a negative box listing the model's errors above the fields\n- Login's notices after logout or an expired session — a flash, not the inline alert\n- A password field with the toggle pressed — the text shows and the icon turns primary-fg\n- Desktop for every auth-layout screen — the same one-column card Login draws\n- TOTP · Alta when already enrolled — it redirects to Ajustes, or to the wizard's summary mid-wizard, with \"La verificación en dos pasos ya está activa en esta cuenta.\"\n- Códigos reloaded after they left the session — it redirects with \"Los códigos solo se muestran una vez. Podrás generar unos nuevos desde Ajustes.\" to Ajustes, or to the summary mid-wizard\n- The QR is drawn as an icon; the code renders a real one on a white plate\n- 400 — same layout as 404, icon report: \"Solicitud inválida\" / \"El servidor no pudo entender la petición. Vuelve a intentarlo desde el inicio.\" / Ir al inicio\n- 406 (allow_browser) — icon browser_not_supported: \"Tu navegador no es compatible\" / \"Stockerly necesita un navegador moderno para funcionar. Actualiza el tuyo o abre la app en otro.\" / Ir al inicio\n- 422 — icon block: \"No se pudo procesar el cambio\" / \"El cambio que intentaste hacer fue rechazado. Suele pasar cuando la sesión ya expiró: recarga e inténtalo otra vez.\" / Recargar · Ir al inicio\n- Errores in dark mode (each file's prefers-color-scheme block) and at ≥640px, where the buttons sit in a row\n- The icon ring's small drop shadow (no token for it); the 500 bar's ends are primary at 10%, drawn primary-muted\n\n7. OPEN FINDINGS\n- None.\n\n8. HISTORY\n→ Log frame, below this brief.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
